PackageName: spihal
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-spihal
PackageVersion: 1.1.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: asiball ()
PackageDownloadLocation: git+https://github.com/asiball/private-test-cpp-project.git#spi-hal
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: MIT
PackageLicenseDeclared: MIT
PackageCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2024 asiball
PackageComment: Linux SPI userspace HAL static library (libspihal.a). Includes SpiDriver (spidev ioctl interface) and KernelSpiDriver (custom kernel module ioctl interface). Uses syslog for logging, fcntl/unistd for device file access.

PackageName: i2chal
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-i2chal
PackageVersion: 1.1.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: asiball ()
PackageDownloadLocation: git+https://github.com/asiball/private-test-cpp-project.git#i2c-hal
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: MIT
PackageLicenseDeclared: MIT
PackageCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2024 asiball
PackageComment: Linux I2C userspace HAL static library (libi2chal.a). I2cDriver wraps i2c-dev (ioctl I2C_SLAVE / I2C_RDWR for repeated-start register reads). Independent of spi-hal; uses common/logger.hpp for logging.

PackageName: gpio
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-gpio
PackageVersion: 1.1.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: asiball ()
PackageDownloadLocation: git+https://github.com/asiball/private-test-cpp-project.git#gpio
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: MIT
PackageLicenseDeclared: MIT
PackageCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2024 asiball
PackageComment: GPIO edge-interrupt static library (libgpio.a). GpioLine uses the Linux GPIO character device v2 uABI (GPIO_V2_GET_LINE_IOCTL) and waits for edge events with epoll. No external dependency (no libgpiod).

PackageName: ads1115
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-ads1115
PackageVersion: 1.1.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: asiball ()
PackageDownloadLocation: git+https://github.com/asiball/private-test-cpp-project.git#libsensor
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: MIT
PackageLicenseDeclared: MIT
PackageCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2024 asiball
PackageComment: ADS1115 sensor shared library (libads1115.so). High-level Ads1115 class providing read_raw / read_voltage over ADS1115 (4ch / 16bit I2C ADC). PIMPL idiom, dependency injection on II2cDriver. Built only when i2c-hal is present.

PackageName: my-spi-driver
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-my-spi-driver
PackageVersion: 1.1.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: asiball ()
PackageDownloadLocation: git+https://github.com/asiball/private-test-cpp-project.git#kernel
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: GPL-2.0-only
PackageLicenseDeclared: GPL-2.0-only
PackageCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2024 asiball
PackageComment: Linux kernel SPI device driver module (my_spi_driver.ko). Registers with Linux SPI subsystem via probe(), exposes /dev/my_spi_dev character device, controlled via MY_SPI_IOC_CONFIG/MY_SPI_IOC_TRANSFER ioctl. Requires running Linux kernel with SPI subsystem enabled.

PackageName: libsensor
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-libsensor
PackageVersion: 1.1.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: asiball ()
PackageDownloadLocation: git+https://github.com/asiball/private-test-cpp-project.git#libsensor
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: MIT
PackageLicenseDeclared: MIT
PackageCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2024 asiball
PackageComment: MCP3008 sensor shared library (libsensor.so). High-level Sensor class providing read_raw / read_voltage / read_raw_async over MCP3008 (8ch / 10bit SPI ADC). PIMPL idiom, dependency injection on ISpiDriver.

PackageName: libadxl345
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-libadxl345
PackageVersion: 1.1.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: asiball ()
PackageDownloadLocation: git+https://github.com/asiball/private-test-cpp-project.git#libadxl345
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: MIT
PackageLicenseDeclared: MIT
PackageCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2024 asiball
PackageComment: ADXL345 accelerometer shared library (libadxl345.so). High-level Adxl345 class providing register-map access (read_reg / write_reg / update_bits) and read_raw / read_g over ADXL345 (3-axis SPI accelerometer). Register-type device example contrasting MCP3008. PIMPL idiom, dependency injection on ISpiDriver; static-links spi-hal.

PackageName: device-ctl
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-device-ctl
PackageVersion: 1.1.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: asiball ()
PackageDownloadLocation: git+https://github.com/asiball/private-test-cpp-project.git#cli
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: MIT
PackageLicenseDeclared: MIT
PackageCopyrightText: Copyright (c) 2024 asiball
PackageComment: Command-line interface tool for device management with background monitoring.

PackageName: googletest
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-googletest
PackageVersion: 1.14.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: Google LLC ()
PackageDownloadLocation: https://github.com/google/googletest/releases/tag/v1.14.0
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: BSD-3-Clause
PackageLicenseDeclared: BSD-3-Clause
PackageCopyrightText: Copyright 2008, Google Inc.
PackageComment: C++ testing and mocking framework (GTest + GMock). Test-only dependency via CMake find_package(GTest). Installed from Ubuntu 24.04 libgtest-dev.

PackageName: glibc
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-glibc
PackageVersion: NOASSERTION
PackageSupplier: Organization: Free Software Foundation ()
PackageDownloadLocation: NOASSERTION
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: LGPL-2.1-or-later
PackageLicenseDeclared: LGPL-2.1-or-later
PackageCopyrightText: NOASSERTION
PackageComment: GNU C Library. Provides POSIX interfaces used across driver and library components: pthread (thread management in libsensor), syslog.h (logger.hpp in spi-hal), fcntl.h/unistd.h (file operations in spi_driver.cpp and kernel_spi_driver.cpp), sys/ioctl.h (ioctl calls in both drivers).

PackageName: linux-kernel-headers
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-linux-kernel-headers
PackageVersion: NOASSERTION
PackageSupplier: Organization: Linux Kernel Organization ()
PackageDownloadLocation: NOASSERTION
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: GPL-2.0-only WITH Linux-syscall-note
PackageLicenseDeclared: GPL-2.0-only WITH Linux-syscall-note
PackageCopyrightText: NOASSERTION
PackageComment: Linux kernel headers. Userspace UAPI (Linux-syscall-note exception applies): linux/spi/spidev.h (SpiDriver), linux/ioctl.h and linux/types.h (my_spi_dev.h shared ioctl definitions). Kernel module internal headers: linux/spi/spi.h, linux/module.h, linux/miscdevice.h, linux/uaccess.h, linux/slab.h, linux/mutex.h (my_spi_driver.c). Build-time only for userspace; kernel module compiled against the running kernel's build tree.

PackageName: libstdc++
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-libstdcxx
